WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.370
So yesterday the egg man called in and the
egg man says Biden will win Florida because

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.400
Trump lost his former home state of New York.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.430
His home state is now Florida.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:15.500
And old folks in Florida don't like Trump
and they like Biden.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.820
Okay, that was the egg man yesterday.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:23.190
Here's a different perspective with a shot
across the bow at the egg man saying it's

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.020
actually Trump who's going to win Florida.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.210
Take a listen.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.320
Yeah, I think Trump is going to win in Florida.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.590
And the proof is.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:42.000
Recently we tried to get legalization of marijuana
on the ballot and we couldn't even get 600000

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.570
signatures to get marijuana on the ballot.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:48.920
And I know marijuana is way more popular.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.969
Then Joe Biden is.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:59.330
So, you know, there's not a lot of people
that vote Democratic or the system is heavily

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.330
rigged.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.030
But yeah.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:05.799
OK, so listen, cannabis in Florida.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:10.130
I don't think that you can say that because
they couldn't get six hundred thousand signatures

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.579
for cannabis legalization in Florida.

00:01:12.579 --> 00:01:14.609
It means Joe Biden is going to lose.

00:01:14.609 --> 00:01:15.829
And in fact, there are lots.

00:01:15.829 --> 00:01:19.659
Remember, Florida has the fifth oldest population
in the country.

00:01:19.659 --> 00:01:24.570
There are lots of older folks in Florida who
have no interest in seeing marijuana legalized,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:29.289
but they still are onboard with Joe Biden's
ideas rather than Donald Trump.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:35.609
So my point is, I don't think we can glean
anything about the Florida presidential election

00:01:35.609 --> 00:01:39.079
because of the failure of the cannabis signature
initiative.

00:01:39.079 --> 00:01:40.640
That's my perspective right now.

